00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.460
I actually didn't know.

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:12.760
I loved that prologue.

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:15.700
I was like, this is really cool, because it's like, it's like before you even start the game,

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:19.160
